# MAVLink stream rates the NOMAD core consumes, applied to SITL at startup.
#
# ArduPilot streams position, attitude and extended status only after a GCS
# requests the group: on a fresh passive link these rates are zero and the
# vehicle emits little more than heartbeats. The C++ core deliberately does not
# request streams, so the stack sets them here instead, on SERIAL0 - the link
# MAVProxy forwards from to every host-side copy the core and its scenarios read.
#
# SR0_POSITION  GLOBAL_POSITION_INT (position and altitude), GPS_RAW_INT (fix)
# SR0_EXT_STAT  SYS_STATUS (battery voltage and remaining)
# SR0_EXTRA1    ATTITUDE
# SR0_EXTRA2    VFR_HUD (groundspeed, heading)
SR0_POSITION 5
SR0_EXT_STAT 2
SR0_EXTRA1 5
SR0_EXTRA2 2
